---
description: i18n and locale message sync
globs: src/i18n/**,src/messages/**,public/content/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Locales: `en`, `pt-BR`, `es`, `it`. Explicit locale paths; no runtime locale detection.
- **Sync rule:** Any key or `public/content/.../<locale>.md` change → update **all four** locales in the same change.
- Stable message keys; simple strings in JSON; formatting in code.
- Search index: see `docs/search-index.md`.
